    "title": "Who among former South SF Bay area high school stars will participate in events the week of Monday, Sept. 29? - South SF Bay News",
    "text": "These ex-South SF Bay area high school athletes will be competing in the week starting Monday, Sept. 29.\nAmari Bluford\nIdaho Yotes\nSophomore\n5′9″ 160\nChristopher High School\nHometown: Gilroy\nNext Game: vs. Simpson Red Hawks, Saturday, Oct. 4, 12:30 p.m.\nAustin Jennings\nLake Erie Storm\nSophomore\n6′4″ 235\nLive Oak High School\nNext Game: vs. Thomas More Saints, Saturday, Oct. 4, 7 p.m.\nCaleb Ojeda\nOregon State Beavers\n5′9″ 186\nLive Oak High School\nHometown: Morgan Hill\nNext Game: vs. Appalachian State Mountaineers, Saturday, Oct. 4, 12:30 p.m.\nDomanick DeLeon-Catano\nMayville State Comets\nJunior\n5′11″ 190\nGilroy High School\nHometown: Morgan Hill\nNext Game: vs. Dickinson State Blue Hawks, Saturday, Oct. 4, 12 p.m.\nJonathan Cruz\nSouthern Oregon Raiders\nFreshman\n5′11″ 165\nAnn Sobrato High School\nHometown: San Jose\nNext Game: vs. Montana Western Bulldogs, Saturday, Oct. 4, 1 p.m.\nNick Fernandez\nPuget Sound Loggers\nSenior\n5′11″ 190\nAnn Sobrato High School\nHometown: San Pedro\nNext Game: vs. Lewis & Clark Pioneers, Saturday, Oct. 4, 1 p.m.\nTyler Pacheco\nChapman Panthers\nSenior\n6′2″ 205\nSan Benito High School\nHometown: Hollister\nNext Game: vs. Redlands Bulldogs, Saturday, Oct. 4, 7 p.m.",
